<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>مجمع الأسرة لطب الأسنان والجلدية | فروع الأحساء</title>
  
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
  
  <style>
    :root {
      --brand-teal: #0097A7;
      --brand-teal-dark: #007982;
      --brand-teal-light: #E0F7FA;
      --brand-lime: #8BC34A;
      --brand-lime-dark: #689F38;
      --brand-lime-light: #F1F8E9;
      --brand-dark: #0F172A;
      --brand-surface: #F8FAFC;
    }
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      background-color: var(--brand-surface);
      color: #334155;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 16px;
    }
    /* Top Bar */
    .topbar {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--brand-teal-dark), var(--brand-teal), var(--brand-lime-dark));
      color: #fff;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .badge-tabby {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
      padding: 2px 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    /* Header */
    header {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
    }
    .nav-wrap {
      height: 75px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .logo-icon {
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand-teal), var(--brand-lime));
      border-radius: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: white;
      font-size: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 151, 167, 0.3);
    }
    .logo-text h1 {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--brand-teal);
      line-height: 1.1;
    }
    .logo-text span {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--brand-lime-dark);
    }
    .nav-btn {
      background: var(--brand-teal);
      color: white;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }
    .nav-btn:hover {
      background: var(--brand-teal-dark);
    }
    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--brand-teal-light) 0%, #ffffff 100%);
      padding: 40px 0 60px 0;
    }
    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    @media (min-width: 900px) {
      .hero-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
      }
    }
    .hero-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--brand-lime-light);
      color: var(--brand-lime-dark);
      border: 1px solid var(--brand-lime);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #0f172a;
      line-height: 1.25;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .hero-title span {
      color: var(--brand-teal);
    }
    .hero-desc {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #64748b;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .features-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .feat-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 14px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .feat-card i {
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      display: block;
    }
    .feat-card h4 {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #1e293b;
    }
    .feat-card p {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #64748b;
    }
    /* Booking Card */
    .booking-box {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 28px;
      border: 2px solid var(--brand-teal);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 151, 167, 0.15);
    }
    .booking-box h3 {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #0f172a;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .booking-box p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #64748b;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .form-group {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .form-group label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #334155;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .form-group input, .form-group select {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 14px;
      outline: none;
    }
    .form-group input:focus, .form-group select:focus {
      border-color: var(--brand-teal);
      background: #ffffff;
    }
    .submit-btn {
      width: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #10b981, #059669);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 10px;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }
    .submit-btn:hover {
      opacity: 0.95;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }
    /* Branches Section */
    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 50px 0 30px;
    }
    .section-title h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #0f172a;
    }
    .section-title p {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    .branches-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(130px, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .branch-pill {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 12px 8px;
      text-align: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }
    .branch-pill.active {
      background: var(--brand-teal);
      color: white;
      border-color: var(--brand-teal);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 151, 167, 0.3);
    }
    .active-branch-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 2px solid var(--brand-teal);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }
    .card-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }
    .action-btn {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 140px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 6px;
      color: white;
    }
    .btn-call { background: #0f172a; }
    .btn-wa { background: #10b981; }
    .btn-map { background: #ffffff; color: #334155; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; }
    /* Services */
    .services-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }
    .service-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .service-card h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin: 10px 0 6px;
    }
    .service-card p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #64748b;
    }
    /* Floating WhatsApp */
    .float-wa {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 24px;
      left: 24px;
      width: 58px;
      height: 58px;
      background: #10b981;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
      z-index: 100;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- شريط الميزات العلوي -->
  <div class="topbar">
    <div>
      <i class="fa-solid fa-award"></i> خبرة أكثر من 30 سنة بالأحساء • نستقبل كافة شركات التأمين
